@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 结束充电与自动扣费时序图

' 所有 SQL 操作使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，禁止字符串拼接
actor 用户 as U
participant "Flutter 客户端" as FE
participant "充电控制器" as Ctrl
participant "安全过滤器链" as Security
participant "充电服务" as Service
participant "计费服务" as Bill
participant "支付服务" as Pay
database 数据库 as DB

U -> FE: 点击"结束充电"
FE -> Ctrl: HTTP POST /api/v1/charges/stop\n{recordId}
note right FE : ApiService.stopCharge()\n请求自动附加 JWT Token

group 授权检查 [Spring Security Filter Chain]
  Ctrl -> Security: JwtAuthenticationFilter 解析 Token\n提取 principal (userId, role)

  Security -> Security: @PreAuthorize("(#record.userId == authentication.principal.id) or hasRole('ADMIN')")
  note right Security : 验证当前用户是否为充电记录所有者\n或拥有 ADMIN 角色\n不通过则返回 403 Forbidden
end

Ctrl -> Service: 请求结束充电 (已通过授权)

Service -> Pay: 校验并扣费 {userId, amount=22.50}

group 事务 [atomic] 覆盖: 查询余额(FOR UPDATE) + 更新充电记录 + 扣减余额 + 插入支付记录 + 更新桩状态 + 插入审计日志
  Service -> DB: SELECT cr.*, c.status, u.balance\nFROM charge_records cr\nJOIN chargers c ON cr.charger_id = c.id\nJOIN users u ON cr.user_id = u.id\nWHERE cr.id = ? FOR UPDATE -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，带行锁，确保事务内独占访问
  note right DB : FOR UPDATE 行锁防止并发扣费\n锁释放由事务提交/回滚自动管理\nPostgreSQL MVCC 保证更新仅提交后可见
  DB --> Service: 充电记录、桩状态、用户余额

  Service -> Bill: 计算充电量与费用
  Bill --> Service: energyKwh=15.0, fee=22.50

  alt 余额充足
    Pay -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET end_time=now(), energy_kwh=15.0, fee=22.50, status='completed' WHERE id = ? -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
    DB --> Pay: 更新成功

    Pay -> DB: UPDATE users SET balance = balance - 22.50 WHERE id = ? AND balance >= 22.50 -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，原子扣减
    DB --> Pay: 扣费成功

    Pay -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (id, user_id, charge_record_id, amount, status) VALUES (?, ?, ?, 22.50, 'success') -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
    DB --> Pay: 记录成功

    Pay --> Service: 扣费成功

    Service -> DB: UPDATE chargers SET status = 'idle' WHERE id = ? AND status = 'charging' -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，乐观写条件
    DB --> Service: 桩已释放

    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, detail) VALUES (?, 'user', 'stop_charge', '结束充电-扣费成功') -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
  else 余额不足
    Pay --> Service: 余额不足

    Service -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET end_time=now(), energy_kwh=15.0, fee=22.50, status='completed', deduction_status='arrears' WHERE id = ? -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
    note right DB : fee 记录应收金额(22.50元)，deduction_status=arrears 标记欠费\n用户充值后通过自动扣费或后台补扣完成扣款
    DB --> Service: 标记欠费

    Service -> DB: UPDATE chargers SET status = 'idle' WHERE id = ? AND status = 'charging' -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，欠费时释放桩物理状态
    DB --> Service: 桩已释放

    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, detail) VALUES (?, 'user', 'charge_arrears', '余额不足-标记欠费') -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
  end
end

alt 余额充足
  Service --> Ctrl: 充电结束 {fee=22.50, energy=15.0}
  Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 JSON {fee, energy, deductionStatus: 'paid'}
  FE --> U: 显示"充电完成，已扣费 22.50 元"
else 余额不足
  Service --> Ctrl: 欠费提示
  Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 JSON {fee, energy, deductionStatus: 'arrears'}
  FE --> U: 显示"余额不足，已标记欠费，请联系管理员充值"
end
@enduml